# Dynamic map copy-on-write performance

Measures repeated assignment of a map value followed by mutation of the copy.
Each mutation must detach the shared map payload while leaving the source map
unchanged.

>>> checkpoint map-implementation-baseline d74f693 map implementation baseline
The baseline is the first committed native map implementation.

>>> source
let source = {
    "value": 0,
    "stable": 1,
    "other": 2
}
let copy = source

for (iteration in 0..50000) {
    copy = source
    copy["value"] = iteration
}

print(source["value"])
print(copy["value"])
